    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/6bba349207441af2e7f044ccea613b4b.poster.avif?t=1622143231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/6bba349207441af2e7f044ccea613b4b.webm?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/6bba349207441af2e7f044ccea613b4b.mp4?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Wind Up! is a one-hit KO multiplayer fighting game for 2 - 4 players where wind-up toys punch each other with spring-loaded fists to prove who is the top toy!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/0e9294732f98e228c3b82ee646ddada5.avif?t=1622143231\" /></div><br>Ranging from standard deathmatches (&quot;Last Toy Standing&quot;), to time-based games (&quot;Point Panic&quot;), a mode based on classic spinning tops (&quot;Spin to Win.&quot;), Coin Collecting, First Person Punching and more to come Wind Up! has plenty of ways to make some mayhem!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/50a77621190cf1e5ae4b63d840783249.poster.avif?t=1622143231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/50a77621190cf1e5ae4b63d840783249.webm?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/50a77621190cf1e5ae4b63d840783249.mp4?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/cd42d702b67a4b88851ef572b98ad4e4.avif?t=1622143231\" /></div><br>Featuring a variety of perilous levels! From the dizzying heights of the living room table, to the deadly kitchen sink, an action-filled toy racecar track and even a hazardous school playground! There's plenty of levels where you can duke it out with your buddies!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/e812c7f6086ea8c20b0b8acb238bca1b.poster.avif?t=1622143231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/e812c7f6086ea8c20b0b8acb238bca1b.webm?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/e812c7f6086ea8c20b0b8acb238bca1b.mp4?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/13535b3cf24f12e08b8e8f0875385e48.avif?t=1622143231\" /></div><br>Add temporary power-up accessories to your toy to gain an advantage over your rivals! Includes Rocket Punch, Super Spinny Spikey Balls, the Terrifying Power of Bubbles and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/3ff36d432170e8df59cf38d13bf9f1ce.poster.avif?t=1622143231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/3ff36d432170e8df59cf38d13bf9f1ce.webm?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/3ff36d432170e8df59cf38d13bf9f1ce.mp4?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/ebc403d742d3374d8305ce7fc5511346.avif?t=1622143231\" /></div><br>Customise your toy to stand out from the crowd with a large selection of stylish(?) hats!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/d1a165f1e0ef74bff81375f225a0674c.poster.avif?t=1622143231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/d1a165f1e0ef74bff81375f225a0674c.webm?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/d1a165f1e0ef74bff81375f225a0674c.mp4?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/5584fd35fe251d368fe8a8a0fc094c05.avif?t=1622143231\" /></div><br>We at Fat Familiar (the indie studio behind Wind Up!) are currently brewing up more features! Including but not limited to game modes, levels and hats. Stay tuned for updates!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/6bba349207441af2e7f044ccea613b4b.poster.avif?t=1622143231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/6bba349207441af2e7f044ccea613b4b.webm?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/6bba349207441af2e7f044ccea613b4b.mp4?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Wind Up! is a one-hit KO multiplayer fighting game for 2 - 4 players where wind-up toys punch each other with spring-loaded fists to prove who is the top toy!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/0e9294732f98e228c3b82ee646ddada5.avif?t=1622143231\" /></div><br>Ranging from standard deathmatches (&quot;Last Toy Standing&quot;), to time-based games (&quot;Point Panic&quot;), a mode based on classic spinning tops (&quot;Spin to Win.&quot;), Coin Collecting, First Person Punching and more to come Wind Up! has plenty of ways to make some mayhem!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/50a77621190cf1e5ae4b63d840783249.poster.avif?t=1622143231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/50a77621190cf1e5ae4b63d840783249.webm?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638470/extras/50a77621190cf1e5ae4b63d840783249.mp4?t=1622143231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/